      "edited": "2026-11-06T22:52:31.353Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-06T23:08:05.536Z",
          "html": "<p>Fixed: the handles read <b>ana.rs.spell.space</b>, singular, in P16, Q17 and the Spaces guide; the decision is <a href=\"#q27\">Q27</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>spell.space is yours: registered at Squarespace on 2026-10-31, its records at Squarespace. It's now on the Mail, Domains And Hosting guide, with where spell.app's and spell.social's records live (spell.social's are at Cloudflare).</li>\n  <li>Left as they are: <code>spell.spaces</code> the projects folder on disk, which is a different thing.</li>\n  <li>The lexicon names the code writes (<code>spaces.spell...</code>) came from the same mistake: <a href=\"#i9\">I9</a>, to fix before any lexicon is published for real.</li>\n</ul>"
        }
      ],
      "done": {
        "how": "good",
        "at": "2026-11-06T23:21:48.679Z",
        "by": "owenoak"
      },
